# Descriptor: [B- -> anti-D_0*0 l- nu, anti-D_0*0 -> anti-D0 eta] gap mode (resonant S-wave)
# NickName: Bu_D0stlnu_Deta_gapmodes
# Documentation: Gap mode; D_0*(2300) -> D0 eta, S-wave component from coupled-channel fit
#   (arXiv:2605.03021, Eq. 38: BF(B+->D0eta lnu) ~ 0.56e-4).
#   LLSW for B -> D_0* l nu; PHSP for scalar -> pseudoscalar + pseudoscalar sub-decay.
# Responsible: Philipp Horak
# Email: phorak@uvic.ca
# Date: 20260519

Alias D0steta0sig anti-D_0*0
Alias anti-D0steta0sig D_0*0
ChargeConj D0steta0sig anti-D0steta0sig

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B-sig B+sig  VSS;
Enddecay

Decay B-sig
0.500 D0steta0sig  e-  anti-nu_e  PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
0.500 D0steta0sig  mu- anti-nu_mu PHOTOS LLSW 0.68 -0.2 0.3;
Enddecay
CDecay B+sig

Decay D0steta0sig
1.0   anti-D0  eta   PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay anti-D0steta0sig

End
